WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.600
Thirty years, I've told collectors the truth about their paintings.

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.900
It has rarely made me popular.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.800
Your phone is about to do the same.

4
00:00:12.351 --> 00:00:14.757
Point it at something you don't own yet.

5
00:00:14.977 --> 00:00:20.220
No label. No title. No artist. Just the picture.

6
00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:25.839
It reads the surface. The impasto. The palette knife.

7
00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:30.482
Then it names it. Solitary Sentinel. Oil on canvas.

8
00:00:30.482 --> 00:00:31.758
Expressionism.

9
00:00:31.978 --> 00:00:34.785
And then it does the thing nobody expects.

10
00:00:35.005 --> 00:00:36.635
It refuses to flatter it.

11
00:00:36.855 --> 00:00:41.811
Competently executed, it says. Strong decorative appeal. And its

12
00:00:41.811 --> 00:00:46.082
collectible value? That would depend on an artist you'd

13
00:00:46.082 --> 00:00:47.988
have to go and research.

14
00:00:48.208 --> 00:00:52.143
Which is the honest answer. Not the flattering one.

15
00:00:52.363 --> 00:00:53.084
Attesté.

